      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 24,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring groomers and helpful reception"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise groomer Natasha and receptionist Zach for their welcoming, attentive, and helpful service. Reviewers note that staff take time to explain grooming plans and listen closely to breed styling requests. While isolated reviews noted an impatient front desk encounter or feeling unwelcome, the vast majority highlight warm hospitality."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "High-quality styling and coat restoration"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently express delight with haircut results, baths, and de-shedding treatments for poodles, golden retrievers, and doodles. Pet parents emphasize that dogs return clean, fluffy, and beautifully styled, with groomers skillfully fixing previous bad haircuts, preserving topcoats, and sending detailed post-groom report cards."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient handling for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers often commend the salon for handling anxious dogs, large breeds, and senior pets with patience and care. Dog owners report that timid dogs and senior animals with special needs—including blind or deaf dogs—are treated gently and calmly, leaving the spa visibly happy and relaxed without signs of grooming stress."
      }
    }
  ],
